{"seq":1,"slug":"paths-shapes","title":"路径与形状","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/paths-shapes","wordCount":1098,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"路径与形状\">路径与形状</h1><p>除了 <code>fillRect</code>/<code>strokeRect</code>/<code>clearRect</code> 这三个直接作用于矩形的「快捷方法」，Canvas 上几乎所有矢量绘制都要经过「路径」这个中间层。你不会直接「画一个圆」，而是先往一条路径里添加一段圆弧，再决定填充还是描边它。这种「先描述几何、后决定如何呈现」的两段式分离，是 Canvas 矢量绘制的核心结构，也是初学者最容易写错的地方——忘了 <code>beginPath</code> 会让本帧的路径和上帧的混在一起，画出一团莫名其妙的连线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一条路径是一串子路径（subpath）的集合，每条子路径由直线段、弧、贝塞尔曲线构成。绘制分两个阶段：构建路径（path-building）和提交绘制（painting）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;beginPath()&lt;br/&gt;清空当前路径&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;moveTo(x,y)&lt;br/&gt;起一条新子路径&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;lineTo / arc / bezierCurveTo&lt;br/&gt;添加线段与曲线&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;closePath()?&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;闭合&quot;| E[&quot;回到子路径起点&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;开放&quot;| F[&quot;保持开放&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;fill() 填充&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; H[&quot;stroke() 描边&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; I[&quot;clip() 裁剪&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; J[&quot;路径仍在内存&lt;br/&gt;可再次 fill/stroke&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"beginPath()&lt;br/&gt;清空当前路径\"] --&gt; B[\"moveTo(x,y)&lt;br/&gt;起一条新子路径\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"lineTo / arc / bezierCurveTo&lt;br/&gt;添加线段与曲线\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"closePath()?\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"闭合\"| E[\"回到子路径起点\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"开放\"| F[\"保持开放\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"fill() 填充\"]\n  F --&gt; H[\"stroke() 描边\"]\n  E --&gt; I[\"clip() 裁剪\"]\n  G --&gt; J[\"路径仍在内存&lt;br/&gt;可再次 fill/stroke\"]</pre><p>关键认知：路径独立于「画上去」这一步。同一条路径可以先 <code>fill</code> 再 <code>stroke</code>（先填充再勾边），路径不会因为画过一次就消失，直到下一次 <code>beginPath</code> 才被清空。这就是为什么每帧、每个独立形状开头都应调 <code>beginPath</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路径构建命令\">路径构建命令</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>beginPath()</code></td>\n<td>清空当前路径，开始新路径</td>\n<td>每个独立形状前必调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>moveTo(x,y)</code></td>\n<td>不画线，移动「笔」到起点</td>\n<td>起一条新子路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lineTo(x,y)</code></td>\n<td>从当前点画直线到 (x,y)</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>arc(x,y,r,a0,a1,ccw)</code></td>\n<td>画圆弧（圆心 + 半径 + 起止角）</td>\n<td>弧度制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>arcTo(x1,y1,x2,y2,r)</code></td>\n<td>用两条切线和半径画圆角</td>\n<td>常用于圆角连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>quadraticCurveTo</code></td>\n<td>二次贝塞尔（1 个控制点）</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bezierCurveTo</code></td>\n<td>三次贝塞尔（2 个控制点）</td>\n<td>最灵活的曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rect(x,y,w,h)</code></td>\n<td>添加矩形子路径</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>roundRect(x,y,w,h,radii)</code></td>\n<td>添加圆角矩形子路径</td>\n<td>见下</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>closePath()</code></td>\n<td>闭合当前子路径回到起点</td>\n<td>填充时影响轮廓</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三次贝塞尔曲线由起点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、两个控制点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_1,P_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、终点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定，参数方程为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(t)=(1-t)^3 P_0 + 3(1-t)^2 t\\,P_1 + 3(1-t)t^2 P_2 + t^3 P_3,\\quad t\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理解这个公式有助于你预测控制点怎么「拉扯」曲线，从而精确设计平滑路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"roundrect-终于内置的圆角矩形\">roundRect：终于内置的圆角矩形</h2><p>长期以来画圆角矩形要靠四段 <code>arcTo</code> 手工拼，繁琐易错。<code>roundRect()</code> 现已成为标准方法（据 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CanvasRenderingContext2D\">MDN CanvasRenderingContext2D</a>），它的 <code>radii</code> 参数语义与 CSS <code>border-radius</code> 一致——可传单个数（四角相同）或最多四个数（分别控制四角）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"ctx.beginPath();&#10;ctx.roundRect(20, 20, 200, 100, [16, 16, 0, 0]); // 上两角圆、下两角直&#10;ctx.fillStyle = &#39;#0a84ff&#39;;&#10;ctx.fill();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">roundRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 上两角圆、下两角直</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.fillStyle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '#0a84ff'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"填充规则-描边样式与裁剪\">填充规则、描边样式与裁剪</h2><p><code>fill()</code> 在路径有自交或嵌套（如「回」字、五角星）时，需要规则判断「哪里算内部」。Canvas 支持两种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>判定方式</th>\n<th>典型差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>非零环绕</td>\n<td><code>fill()</code> 或 <code>fill(&#39;nonzero&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>射线穿越的有向环绕数非零即内部</td>\n<td>五角星中心填充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奇偶规则</td>\n<td><code>fill(&#39;evenodd&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>射线穿越次数为奇即内部</td>\n<td>五角星中心镂空</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>描边由一组状态控制：<code>lineWidth</code>、<code>lineCap</code>（端点形状 butt/round/square）、<code>lineJoin</code>（拐角 miter/round/bevel）、<code>setLineDash</code>（虚线）。这些都是上下文状态机的一部分，设一次后续描边都生效——这点和<a href=\"../foundations/drawing-model\">即时绘制模型</a>里讲的「先设状态、后发命令」一致。</p>\n<p><code>clip()</code> 用当前路径作为裁剪区，此后所有绘制只在该区域内可见。裁剪是绘制状态，会随 <a href=\"../foundations/drawing-model\">save/restore</a> 进出，所以临时裁剪务必包在 <code>save</code>/<code>restore</code> 之间，否则裁剪区会泄漏到后续帧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"path2d-把路径变成可复用对象\">Path2D：把路径变成可复用对象</h2><p>上面的命令式构建每次都要重新发一遍调用。<code>Path2D</code> 把一条路径封装成对象，构建一次、反复绘制，还能用 SVG path 字符串初始化。这对画很多相同图标、或做命中检测时尤其有用——<code>isPointInPath</code> 可以直接接受一个 <code>Path2D</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const star = new Path2D(&#39;M 50 0 L 61 35 H 98 L 68 57 ...&#39;); // SVG 路径语法&#10;for (const { x, y } of positions) {&#10;  ctx.save();&#10;  ctx.translate(x, y);&#10;  ctx.fill(star); // 复用同一个 Path2D&#10;  ctx.restore();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> star</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Path2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'M 50 0 L 61 35 H 98 L 68 57 ...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SVG 路径语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> positions) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">translate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(star); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 复用同一个 Path2D</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">restore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把图形存成 <code>Path2D</code> 对象，正好衔接<a href=\"../interaction/hit-detection\">命中检测</a>中「用 <code>isPointInPath(path, x, y)</code> 判断点击落在哪个图形」的做法，也是<a href=\"../interaction/scene-management\">场景管理</a>里给每个场景对象保存其几何的自然方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Canvas 矢量绘制是两段式：先构建路径（beginPath→moveTo/lineTo/arc/曲线），再提交绘制（fill/stroke/clip）。</li>\n<li>每个独立形状、每帧开头都要 <code>beginPath</code>，否则路径累积串味。</li>\n<li><code>roundRect</code> 已标准化，<code>radii</code> 语义同 CSS <code>border-radius</code>；曲线用二/三次贝塞尔，理解参数方程能精确控形。</li>\n<li>填充有非零环绕与奇偶两种规则（决定自交图形的内外）；描边样式（线宽、端点、拐角、虚线）与裁剪都是会随 save/restore 进出的状态。</li>\n<li><code>Path2D</code> 把路径封装为可复用对象，可接 SVG 字符串，直接服务于命中检测与场景对象的几何存储。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路径与形状","id":"路径与形状"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"路径构建命令","id":"路径构建命令"},{"level":2,"text":"roundRect：终于内置的圆角矩形","id":"roundrect-终于内置的圆角矩形"},{"level":2,"text":"填充规则、描边样式与裁剪","id":"填充规则-描边样式与裁剪"},{"level":2,"text":"Path2D：把路径变成可复用对象","id":"path2d-把路径变成可复用对象"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"坐标系与变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/foundations/coordinate-transforms"},"next":{"title":"文本与图像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/text-images"}}